{"synopsis":"Dari author Absolute Regression & Absolute Dominion. Dan studio yang mengerjakan Pria Tampan Dari Surga.\n\nBaek So-cheon, yang jatuh dari posisi sebagai seniman bela diri terhebat di dunia menjadi sekadar pejabat yang tidak berarti.\n\nIa telah kehilangan kemampuan bela diri dan kehormatannya, tetapi semangatnya tetap tak tergoyahkan... Memulai kembali dari bawah, mantan Supreme Master ini merebut kembali kekuatannya yang hilang dan masa lalunya yang telah terlupakan.\n\nLegenda kedua dunia bela diri tentang manusia terkuat.","alternative_title":"전직지존","author":"Jang Yeonghun, KHJ","artist":"JHS Studio, Son Min","chapters":[{"number":"15","chapter":"15","slug":"ch_15","kc_index":null,"kc_series_slug":null,"date":"2026-07-30"},{"number":"14","chapter":"14","slug":"ch_14","kc_index":null,"kc_series_slug":null,"date":"2026-07-30"},{"number":"13","chapter":"13","slug":"ch_13","kc_index":null,"kc_series_slug":null,"date":"2026-07-30"},{"number":"12","chapter":"12","slug":"ch_12","kc_index":null,"kc_series_slug":null,"date":"2026-07-30"},{"number":"11","chapter":"11","slug":"ch_11","kc_index":null,"kc_series_slug":null,"date":"2026-07-30"},{"number":"10","chapter":"10","slug":"ch_10","kc_index":null,"kc_series_slug":null,"date":"2026-07-30"},{"number":"9","chapter":"9","slug":"ch_9","kc_index":null,"kc_series_slug":null,"date":"2026-07-30"},{"number":"8","chapter":"8","slug":"kc_ch_the-former-absolute-supreme_8","kc_index":8,"kc_series_slug":"the-former-absolute-supreme","date":"2026-07-30","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_09223329-6528-476d-bb37-40905a29bd34/chapter_kc_ch_the-former-absolute-supreme_8/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_09223329-6528-476d-bb37-40905a29bd34/chapter_kc_ch_the-former-absolute-supreme_8/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_09223329-6528-476d-bb37-40905a29bd34/chapter_kc_ch_the-former-absolute-supreme_8/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_09223329-6528-476d-bb37-40905a29bd34/chapte